<title>UK: P&amp;O year pretax profits boosted by disposals.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O year pretax profits boosted by disposals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		40.1		   vs 37.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 17.0		   vs 17.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 30.5		   vs 30.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     332.8		  vs 320.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   7,090		  vs 6,571</p>
<p> Operating profit	 509.8		  vs 490.8</p>
<p>NOTE - P&amp;O said made a pretax profit of 320.4 million before exceptionals, which amounted to a net gain of 12.4 million pounds on disposals, compared to 320.1 million stg in 1995.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pretax profits of 290-316 million stg before exceptionals and a maintained final dividend of 17 pence a share.</p>
<p>Full company name - The Peninsular And Oriental Steam Navigation Co Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
